 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-ORD EM5-DEF L-OK.
     IF WS-LOADED = 0
         PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 2
             CALL "EF5B-ANIM-BUILD" USING WS-I EM5-DEF WS-OK
             MOVE EM5-DEF TO WS-CE(WS-I)
